Subject: Cantor Attention Admission Account

Description: Additive deterministic value-private account of the host gates completed by one successfully admitted attention procedure.

@ [specification_uuid] f8632b62-c3cd-4810-b481-518fe9bca6f7
@ [profile] cantor-attention-admission-account/0.1
@ [source_manifest] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-08-18_attention_admission_account\Source_Document_Manifest.sop
@ [predecessor] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_Declared_Field_Exact_Binding.sop

& [AccountIdentity] is deterministic observation rather than authorization
  + profile is cantor-attention-admission-account/0.1
  + status is admitted
  + account is formed only after schema literal grounding declared binding and catalogue recheck pass
  + account formation has no effects and calls no model or semantic authority
  - never: represent learned confidence or the account itself as authorization

& [IdentityBindings] are exact
  + procedure_id procedure_digest and catalogue_digest identify admitted contract bytes
  + stimulus_sha256 binds the exact caller UTF-8 bytes without echoing content
  + account_digest is the SHA-256 of canonical account JSON and remains outside the account to avoid recursion
  + no time run identity or process identity enters deterministic account bytes

& [FieldAccount] is value-private
  + argument_fields follows selected procedure required-field order
  + every field record contains name schema passed literal_grounding passed and declared_binding passed or not_declared
  + no selected or declared value and no per-value digest appears
  + declared_fields and undeclared_fields are disjoint ordered projections of required fields

& [DeclarationSurface] is closed
  + literal_only means no selected required field had an explicit declaration
  + delimited means at least one selected required field used the bounded colon-or-equals grammar
  + json means the whole stimulus used the closed complete JSON grammar
  + json has zero undeclared fields

& [GateAccount] is concise
  + gates contains schema literal_grounding declared_binding catalogue_recheck and effects
  + schema literal_grounding and catalogue_recheck are passed
  + declared_binding is passed when declarations exist and not_applicable for literal_only
  + effects is passed only with the exact procedure allowed_effects array which remains empty in this catalogue

& [Emission] is additive and pre-semantic
  + write account to immutable run evidence as 01_admission.json
  + route-only and full successful result include admission_account and admission_account_digest
  + existing fields and evaluator interpretation remain valid
  + a selection rejection emits its existing typed fault and no admission account
  + a later Cantor or llama fault may retain the already completed admission account in evidence

& [Acceptance] is measurable
  + [AAA-001] source and source manifest bytes verify
  + [AAA-002] literal-only account identifies every required field as not_declared
  + [AAA-003] partial delimited account separates declared and undeclared fields
  + [AAA-004] closed JSON account marks every required field declared
  + [AAA-005] no stimulus content argument value or value digest occurs in account
  + [AAA-006] same identities and gate facts produce byte-identical canonical account and digest
  + [AAA-007] route-only and full success write and return the account before semantic output
  + [AAA-008] rejected selection writes no admission file
  + [AAA-009] local and EVO-X2 runtime calibration and pinned evaluation regressions pass
  + [AAA-010] catalogue threshold procedure sources shared services and effect boundary remain unchanged

& [SJSProcessingTrace] records seven-fold convergence
  + [fold_1_identity] binds caller contract catalogue and procedure without values
  + [fold_2_honesty] distinguishes learned proposal host admission and semantic authority
  + [fold_3_security] exposes completed gates without widening effects or revealing input content
  + [fold_4_language] freezes three declaration surfaces and one compact account schema
  + [fold_5_compatibility] adds result fields and one evidence file without changing existing meaning
  + [fold_6_data] makes account JSON canonical hashable and reproducible
  + [fold_7_phase_lock] excludes rejected-call traces private reasoning timing and general distributed negotiation

& [Signature] is bounded implementation authority
  + [satisfaction_protocol_uuid] is 0d57dc77-d00c-4f06-94df-a91771a790b4
  + [signature_uuid] is fc5b225a-a05c-4e91-8f17-34dffe3f9b68
  + [source_manifest_sha256] is 3E481947977C88DFA55A2641EC95BABC8CB8D787F2CBF77CD48100B0A71AB9EC
  + [authority_scope] is account constructor additive result and evidence emission focused tests manifest refresh isolated deployment probes proof and closure
  + [invalidation] is value disclosure per-value hashing effect expansion rejected-call admission account semantic call inside construction or replacement of existing result meanings
